{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/971232-when-did-the-spirals-come-out-of-hiding","id":971232,"title":"When did the Spirals come out of hiding?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-17T03:14:47-07:00","id":971232,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> When did the Spirals come out of hiding?","content":"So after the Howlers were corrupted into Spirals they went into hiding to build up their population. But how long before they were confirmed as more then just a rumor? It must have been Multiple generations. I didn't read Dark Age Werewolf, were they active then? I know by the time the Purelands were discovered the Spirals were already in open warfare with the Gaian tribes.<br /> <br /> And now the Dancers are the largest tribe, larger then any two Werewolf tribes. But all other tribes are at record lows. So does it mean this is the largest population in Spiral History?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T07:35:15-07:00","id":971310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/971232-when-did-the-spirals-come-out-of-hiding#post971232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So after the Howlers were corrupted into Spirals they went into hiding to build up their population. But how long before they were confirmed as more then just a rumor? It must have been Multiple generations. I didn't read Dark Age Werewolf, were they active then? I know by the time the Purelands were discovered the Spirals were already in open warfare with the Gaian tribes.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's still a 1400-year timespan, though. The concept of Fallen Fera is not new with the arrival of the BSDs. The concept that they are <i>organized</i> is. The BSDs have probably always been organized in a much more modern way than the Garou Nation has been, so it's probably not until Colonialism forces the Tribes to intermingle on a larger scale that they'd even notice they were all fighting the same infestation of Fallen Garou.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/971232-when-did-the-spirals-come-out-of-hiding#post971232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And now the Dancers are the largest tribe, larger then any two Werewolf tribes. But all other tribes are at record lows. So does it mean this is the largest population in Spiral History?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup. That's what &quot;being on the winning side&quot; means.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T09:03:44-07:00","id":971343,"title":"","content":"In DA Werewolf there are definitely known Black Spiral Hives. In Darkening Skies (1230 AD), there's a somewhat covert, active Hive in Dark Ages Bulgaria (which isn't where modern Bulgaria is). <br /> <br /> One point made in DA is that it's fairly easy for a Caern to &quot;go dark&quot; and nobody knows (or cares) why. It's just harder to get around, even for wolves, the Tribes don't get along very well at all (multi-tribe Caerns are very much the exception), even nearby Caerns of the same tribe can be very competitive (not a lot of Moon Bridge rocks getting exchanged). Meaning it's pretty easy for a Hive to &quot;burrow up&quot;, take out a Caern and no one ends up the wiser.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T12:23:56-07:00","id":971452,"title":"","content":"the first dark ages book, which was just a relatively thin soft cover, it notes expliicitly the Dancers are seen as a joke, a view the Dancers cling to, as if the Nation put all their will and effort together, they could Exterminate the dancers completely.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}